WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.596
Section B question one — online shop orders and warehouse despatch.

00:00:04.596 --> 00:00:09.535
Part (a): classify four items as hardware, software, data, or procedure.

00:00:09.535 --> 00:00:13.308
Thermal despatch printer — hardware; a physical device.

00:00:13.308 --> 00:00:17.630
Stock-management application — software; an executable program.

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.540
Customer order records — data; facts that must be stored.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:26.753
Standard operating guide for checking goods — procedure; steps staff follow.

00:00:26.753 --> 00:00:30.183
Any three correct classifications earn full marks.

00:00:30.183 --> 00:00:34.848
Do not call order records software, or call the printer output data.
